  :body "Clause 0 carrier and kernel. 4 of 21 pairs have no meet, so this also fails hasMeets. The kernels separate most here: at horizon 6, co-application p 0.853, list and interleaving p 0 (list's E[#wants] 1.16-1.64 across 21 linear extensions: the precedence list silently picks a number in that range). No wide state has a conflict (no enabled pattern produces what another forbids), in this instance or in 4 and 5; so the case where co-application is unsound is not yet exercised. One more instance with a real conflict is needed before the kernel is settled."}
